evidence.text:
•  We opened 27 new warehouses, including three relocations, for a total of 24 net new warehouses:
    15 in the U.S., two in our Canadian segment, and seven in our Other International segment,
    compared to 30 new warehouses, including one relocation, in 2024;
 •   Net sales increased 8% to $269,912, driven by an increase in comparable sales and sales at new
    warehouses;
 •   Membership  fee revenue  increased 10%  to  $5,323,  driven by new member  sign-ups and
    membership fee increases;
 •   Gross margin percentage increased 20 basis points; 11 basis points excluding the impact of gasoline
     price deflation on net sales;
 •  SG&A expenses as a percentage of net sales increased 11 basis points; three basis points excluding
     the impact of gasoline price deflation;
 •   The effective tax rate in 2025 was 25.1%, compared to 24.4% in 2024;
 •   Net income increased 10% to $8,099, or $18.21 per diluted share compared to $7,367, or $16.56

